Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So it's, it's a big difference what a year can make.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一年真能带来很大改变
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:05.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I thank Him for pulling me through.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N感谢上帝带我走过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:08.93,TL,,0,0,0,,去年 她在辛辛那提的停车场哭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:12.42,TL,,0,0,0,,今年 首冠终于在同一站到来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:15.67,TL,,0,0,0,,联合杯单打{\fs78}3{\fs68}胜{\fs78}1{\fs68}负开局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:19.15,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网连赢{\fs78}4{\fs68}场 {\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛却以{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:21.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}负于斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:46.50,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She takes advantage of an out-of-sorts Coco Gauff,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她击败了状态失常的高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a long way off her best.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N高芙远未发挥最佳水准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Not even an hour!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还不到{\fs78}1{\fs68}小时！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:54.58,TL,,0,0,0,,多哈首战出局 迪拜打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:57.14,TL,,0,0,0,,再到印第安维尔斯赛中退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:00.45,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密 终于打进本季首场决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:12.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Sunshine Double belongs to Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阳光双冠属于萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:14.26,TL,,0,0,0,,斯图加特止步八强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.26,0:01:16.45,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里止步第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:18.24,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马再拿亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.56,TL,,0,0,0,,两场{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛决赛 都没能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Elina Svitolina is a Roman champion once again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯维托丽娜再度称霸罗马
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:45.37,TL,,0,0,0,,卫冕之旅止于第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.37,0:01:48.76,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 仍被波塔波娃逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:03.11,TL,,0,0,0,,柏林首战出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:05.82,TL,,0,0,0,,温网却拼到半决赛抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:08.80,TL,,0,0,0,,穆霍娃赢下最后两个小分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:35.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Karolina Muchova is a Wimbledon finalist.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N穆霍娃闯进温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:38.10,TL,,0,0,0,,多伦多止步四强后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.51,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提终于等来首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:44.15,TL,,0,0,0,,先丢本届首盘 随后连赢{\fs78}12{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is the first title of the year for Coco Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是高芙今年的首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:00.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is her second in Cincinnati,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她第二次在辛辛那提夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.49,0:03:06.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it is the 12th singles title of her tremendous career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是她生涯第{\fs78}12{\fs68}座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:09.99,TL,,0,0,0,,美网{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.43,TL,,0,0,0,,她救下两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:13.36,TL,,0,0,0,,逆转安德烈耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:16.61,TL,,0,0,0,,不留遗憾 是她赢球后给出的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:19.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Second match point now for Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在是高芙的第{\fs78}2{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:48.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Somehow she did it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她还是做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:49.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:51.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Took a lot of heart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这需要很大的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:53.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A lot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很大的勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:57.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So far from her best,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她远未打出最佳状态
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:00.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and Coco Gauff still figures out a way{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N高芙依然找到了办法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:02.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to get out of her own way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N跨过自己这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:06.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So honestly, I was just trying to literally leave the court with no regrets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我只想不留遗憾地离开球场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:08.02,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.00,TL,,0,0,0,,又被莱巴金娜逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.33,TL,,0,0,0,,温网 美网 两次止步四强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:37.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Elena Rybakina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:40.34,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that books her ticket{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿到了决赛门票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:43.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to a first US Open final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次闯进美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:50.21,TL,,0,0,0,,北京第四轮出局后退出武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.26,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:54.82,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}公布她连续第五年入围年终
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:59.21,TL,,0,0,0,,本季一冠两亚 两次打进大满贯四强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:02.77,TL,,0,0,0,,年终 你期待她再往前走几步？
